DESCRIPTION:Read [Attention\, Students: Put Your Laptops Away ] (https://ww
 w.npr.org/2016/04/17/474525392/attention-students-put-your-laptops-away)\n
 \nBe prepared to discuss the article next class. Some things to think abou
 t include the goals of the study\, the pros and cons of each note taking m
 ethod\, the data the researchers collected\, and the conclusion(s) made by
  the researchers. \n\nPrior to coming to class\, briefly address those sa
 me prompts on this discussion board.\n\n* the goals of the study\n\n* the 
 pros and cons of each note taking method\n\n* the data the researchers col
 lected\n\n* the conclusion(s) made by the researchers
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Attention\, Students: Put Your Laptops Away (MA-106-02-FL26) [MA-10
 6-01\, 02\, and 06-FL26]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://vmi.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course_
 25210&month=08&year=2026#assignment_301137
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Read <a class="inline_disabled" href="https
 ://www.npr.org/2016/04/17/474525392/attention-students-put-your-laptops-aw
 ay" target="_blank">Attention\, Students: Put Your Laptops Away </a></p>\n
 <p>Be prepared to discuss the article next class. Some things to think abo
 ut include the goals of the study\, the pros and cons of each note taking 
 method\, the data the researchers collected\, and the conclusion(s) made b
 y the researchers.&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>Prior to coming to class\, briefly addre
 ss those same prompts on this discussion board.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the goals o
 f the study</li>\n<li>the pros and cons of each note taking method</li>\n<
 li>the data the researchers collected</li>\n<li>the conclusion(s) made by 
 the researchers</li>\n</ul>
END:VEVENT
