 Don't forget to include an inviting and revealing title. Double-space your
  essay and use Times New Roman 12-point font.\n\n2. Slow and careful proof
 reading has saved many an essay grade. Remember to read your essay out lou
 d! \n\n3. Double-check your MLA citations. A reminder: you only need a pa
 renthetical citation for a coach/teammate quote if you've interviewed that
  person specifically for this essay. You don't need a citation if you are 
