 unity essay below by the start of class on <strong>Tuesday\, Oct. 20</stro
 ng>. This essay is worth <strong>20%</strong> of your grade in the class. 
 On Tuesday\, Oct. 20\, we will have a midterm reflective writing assignmen
 t to be completed in class.</p>\n<p><strong>Essay Reminders:</strong></p>\
 n<p>1. Don't forget to include an inviting and revealing title. Double-spa
 ce your essay and use Times New Roman 12-point font.</p>\n<p>2. Slow and c
 areful proofreading has saved many an essay grade. Remember to read your e
 ssay out loud!&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>3. Double-check your MLA citations. A remind
 er: you only need a parenthetical citation for a coach/teammate quote if y
