DESCRIPTION:Leadership Evaluation paper\n\nList five role models from milit
 ary history\n\nOn a scale of 1-10 evaluate yourself on the Army values and
  the 11 Principles of Leadership.\nOn a scale of 1-10 rank each leadership
  style that you believe to be the best. \n\nWrite a one-page double space
 \, in Times New Roman\, font size 12 paper. In Chicago style. \n\nBriefly
  define what attributes and competencies YOU believe makes a great leader?
 \n\nSecondly\, self-evaluate yourself: What are your strengths\, and what 
 are your weakness.\n\nAll papers must be submitted on paper turn it\, no l
 ater than the close of academic duty (CAD) on 20th Nov. 2026
